{"ref":"BDB, יָבִין","hw":"יָבִין","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יָבִין</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>one who is intelligent, discerning</em><strong>)</strong> two Canaanite kings of Hazor;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:1\" href=\"/Joshua.11.1\">Jos 11:1</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:2\" href=\"/Judges.4.2\">Ju 4:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:7\" href=\"/Judges.4.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:17\" href=\"/Judges.4.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:23\" href=\"/Judges.4.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:24\" href=\"/Judges.4.24\">24</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:10\" href=\"/Psalms.83.10\">ψ 83:10</a>. (But cf. Be <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:2\" href=\"/Judges.4.2\">Ju 4:2</a> Bu<sup>RS 66 ff.</sup>)","next":"BDB, מבונים","prev":"BDB, בִּינָה"}